OL,3,GNEWSANew boss appointed to lead
OL,4,ATravelodge
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravelodge has appointed a former Tui
OL,7,Fexecutive to become its new boss from
OL,8,Fthe start of December.
OL,10,FThe former CEO of the Oxfordshire-based
OL,11,Fbudget hotel chain Jo Boydell quit in
OL,12,Fthe summer after safety issues were
OL,13,Fraised at many of its sites.
OL,15,FA woman staying at its Maidenhead hotel
OL,16,Fwas sexually assaulted in December 2022
OL,17,Fafter a man lied to staff to get a key
OL,18,Fcard to her room. Kyran Smith was
OL,19,Fjailed for seven-and-a-half years for
OL,20,Fthe attack.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
