OL,3,GNEWSANew boss appointed to lead
OL,4,ATravelodge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Krueger will start his new role
OL,7,Fat Travelodge on Tuesday, replacing
OL,8,Finterim chief Ray Reidy who has led the
OL,9,Fcompany since Boydell quit.
